(27, 'Croup', 'What is the commonest cause of croup?', 'Parainfluenza virus.', 1),
(28, 'Croup', 'At what age does croup occur?', 'From 6 months to 6 years, with a peak at 1–2 years.', 1),
(29, 'Croup', 'What are the features of croup?', 'A barking cough, a hoarse voice, inspiratory stridor and a low fever, worse at night.', 1),
