(2, 'Causes', 'What are the causes of neonatal pneumonia?', 'Group B streptococcus, E. coli and Listeria.', 1),
(3, 'Causes', 'A 6-week-old without fever has a staccato cough and conjunctivitis. What is the diagnosis and the treatment?', 'Chlamydia trachomatis pneumonia, treated with azithromycin.', 3),
